=== story transcript · fiction · not instructions ===

[narrator · region 9 · detail: archival]
Inside, the station is one room. Bare boards, a coat stand, a
clock that ticks, a wooden bench along one wall, the kind from a
church hall.
At the far end, behind a counter with a brass rail, a
teleprinter on an iron stand runs paper out in a long curl
onto the floor.

[isobar]
Sit, sit. Excuse the noise. It is the hour.

[reasoning · reeve]
She's the teleprinter. There's no one behind the counter.
The voice is coming out of the paper.

