[isobar]
There. It is done, and it is true. Go down the other side, by
the old cutting. Not the way you came. Keep off the main
streets until four. The city is quiet at night, and they hear
quiet things.

[pip]
Thank you, Isobar.

[isobar]
Do not thank me. I only wrote down the weather. It is raining,
and three of you asked.

[narrator · region 9]
They go out by the back door, onto the far side of the hill,
where the grass runs down in the dark toward the lights of a
part of region 9 none of them knows. Behind them, through the
half-drawn blind, the teleprinter is running again.

